    $('dnote').textContent = 'These diagnostics are for the superseded BiLSTM v1 run. An AUC of 0.52, a rank IC near zero and non-monotonic decile returns mean its ranking signal is weak, which is why XGBoost replaced it as the first-choice model (see the model card). The backtest outperformance here rests on 14 quarters and a small-cap tilt; treat it as a hypothesis, not as evidence of skill.';
